                                                "sense_id": "2363dcbb-e67c-3816-8eb4-0ba13ba2d0f7",
                                                "text": "Along the street, a delivery van’s pop music approaches and recedes with a faint Doppler effect, the cheerless band lifting and dipping a microtone."
